 payments.\n\nRESTRICTED opened on the Bucket Shop launchpad on 25 September 2026 and graduated the same day into a public Uniswap V4 pool paired against USDG. Distribution ran through a public bonding curve open to anyone from the first block, with no presale and no private round. A 99% tax applied to buys in the first three seconds and then expired, which stops automated snipers accumulating supply before ordinary buyers can transact. The launchpad takes a permanent 0% fee from this token as its founding launch.\n\nHolder concentration, stated plainly: total supply is 918,367,347 XGME and the creator wallet holds 388,105,700 of it, about 42 percent. Anyone can verify that on chain.\n\nEvery contract behind the token is source verified on the Robinhood Chain Blockscout explorer: the token, the bonding curve, the fee splitter and the liquidity lock.\n\nBuilt by Bucket Labs LLC, which also operates Bucket Shop.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://sellonly.wtf"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/vyc4t4c7rfxfzug3gupkeg2qo54t3sgtrmkvcxk1wih","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"vyC4T4C7Rfxfzug3guPkeg2Qo54t3SgTrmkVcxK1WiH","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/8ni1T6WU155xJ1Bp?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/ul-N1WFVUtGPOkq7?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/vyC4T4C7Rfxfzug3guPkeg2Qo54t3SgTrmkVcxK1WiH?timestamp=1790454900000","description":"Fees sent to Elon Musk, Nikita Bier, Benji Taylor (head of design at X), Dhruv Batura (head of X Money), John (X Money engineer)","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://usefork.cash/coin/vyC4T4C7Rfxfzug3guPkeg2Qo54t3SgTrmkVcxK1WiH"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/btbh9xeuefgpbmt99nkr4f9q1pcdf11iag9tlihrpump","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"BTbH9XEuEFGpbMt99NkR4F9q1PCdf11iAG9tLiHrpump","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cm